        "description": "Identifies processes started from binaries whose SHA-256 hash matches a Hollow Quill espionage toolkit sample, as reported in campaign PTF-01733. The indicators are synthetic and use reserved address and domain ranges, so they match no real traffic.",
        "false_positives": [
            "Security testing that replays known indicators.",
            "A shared hosting address or domain that later served benign content."
        ],
        "from": "now-9m",
        "index": [
            "logs-endpoint.events.process-*"
        ],
        "language": "eql",
        "license": "Elastic License v2",
        "name": "Hollow Quill Espionage Toolkit: Process started from known malicious binary (PTF-01733)",
        "note": "## Triage and analysis\n\n### Investigating Hollow Quill Espionage Toolkit: Process started from known malicious binary\n\nThis rule matches indicators that the Partner Threat Feed attributes to the Hollow Quill espionage toolkit in campaign PTF-01733.\n\n### Possible investigation steps\n\n- Review the matching event and the host or user it came from.\n- Look for other indicators from the same campaign on the same host.\n- Check the process tree around the event for the initial execution or delivery.\n\n### Response and remediation\n\n- Isolate the host if the match is confirmed.\n- Block the indicators at the network edge and on endpoints.\n- Reset credentials used on the host.\n",
        "query": "process where event.type == \"start\" and process.hash.sha256 in (\"7e579ad8a4e66acbd170762b37f5f613977d036dc8fd782955d7f66631113418\", \"a3e4c2d4016ba10e97a8765d45e1450d679a2948535472d34b7190a34977f369\", \"86c1e61706ce3728ad0a73623da981829a2f1f597975080c48c63baf35cf99c6\", \"beb70cd5c3b095e1ad61c3ea1304b8d65d7f44d0b05b51e525e2acb7d30dcfba\", \"de60725914d792d6905fc610d0efb2ac25163431bd4c246ee0240f006b8a452e\", \"e48b019c8cb284c8ed64cf899c3c3fd2e8a46ac930e45dcdd8e80f4d4ad0f4a9\", \"b6a343beb81112922ab44b6317c38b13c6bae2d1aa3b9235a52bd3e85070e635\", \"1107fdc5e81b138a0f1c8cbb7503a0ae890e5b322d560d86ed622027f7fc9a3e\", \"4b757d2a94c723b870ad764484505edb6d234282903444e4def168b293bfa934\")",
